 "notes": [
  "Rows 2026-11-20 (lane houthavens-memel-wiborg-20261120, round 4): the NE panel (surfaces 1 and 23, 29.5 m) from w03-52s1 (2021-02-24) and w03-52s2 (2025-10-02): a black panelled base of two tall storeys, blank but for a door and one tall window, under two storeys glazed across every bay. The other fronts take the same scheme: the NW full-height surfaces 3 and 20 as the NE, the SE and SW base walls 17 and 15 blank black panels, the set-back upper walls 29, 34 and 46 glazed. Only the NE is photographed square; every group cites its crop.",
  "The painted yellow 41 on the low NE wing (signage.up). Not drawn: the balcony rails and the thin roof canopy of the glazed storeys, the door and tall window in the base."
 ]
